WEBVTT

00:02.500 --> 00:05.710
<b>Chancellor Gilbert, please calm down and listen.</b>

00:06.500 --> 00:07.750
<b>I had a premonition.</b>

00:08.830 --> 00:13.420
<b>Your fiancée, Miss Marianne, will die today.</b>

00:15.330 --> 00:16.000
<b>No...</b>

00:17.080 --> 00:17.920
<b>Why?</b>

00:20.460 --> 00:23.210
<b>Do not touch Elder Sister, you disrespectful lout.</b>

00:26.670 --> 00:27.580
<b>Maria...</b>

00:28.460 --> 00:31.830
<b>You tried to change the laws of the land
for your own self-centered reason,</b>

00:32.130 --> 00:35.080
<b>and you even went so far as to attempt
to get into human trafficking.</b>

00:35.920 --> 00:39.420
<b>Moreover, you even intended to sell
the royal family's confidential information.</b>

00:40.080 --> 00:42.920
<b>Will you admit to your crimes and live as a criminal?</b>

00:43.750 --> 00:48.290
<b>If so, then with your fiancée as the root of all evil, I will-</b>

00:48.420 --> 00:49.130
<b>Stale!</b>

00:53.710 --> 00:57.960
<b>Why? Pride, why are you showing
compassion to a man like this?!</b>

00:58.670 --> 01:00.630
<b>I'm sorry, Stale.</b>

01:01.500 --> 01:05.210
<b>This man isn't the kind of person you should trust!</b>

01:08.290 --> 01:12.790
<b>Even so, he is still one of my beloved subjects...</b>

01:13.790 --> 01:16.040
<b>That man has hurt you.</b>

01:17.080 --> 01:18.580
<b>Your name has been...</b>

01:19.460 --> 01:21.130
<b>Thanks, Stale.</b>

01:21.960 --> 01:26.670
<b>I'm sure you've been watching over me this whole time,
even when I wasn't aware of it.</b>

01:33.080 --> 01:34.210
<b>I apologize.</b>

01:37.250 --> 01:39.130
<b>Maria... Maria...</b>

01:39.630 --> 01:42.130
<b>Listen closely, Gilbert Butler.</b>

01:46.880 --> 01:49.790
<b>Both you and your fiancée...</b>

01:51.290 --> 01:52.130
<b>are forgiven.</b>

03:26.290 --> 03:29.500
<b>"The Insolent Princess and the Judgment"</b>

03:29.630 --> 03:30.710
<b>Princess Pride!</b>

03:30.710 --> 03:32.500
<b>Big Sister! Big Brother!</b>

03:34.710 --> 03:36.790
<b>How did it go with Chancellor Gilbert?</b>

03:37.000 --> 03:39.750
<b>Wait right there! We got a report from
His Majesty the Prince Consort earlier...</b>

03:39.750 --> 03:40.580
<b>Chancellor Gilbert!</b>

03:41.960 --> 03:43.040
<b>Princess Pride!</b>

03:43.170 --> 03:45.540
<b>Princess Pride! Please, do something! Hurry!</b>

03:45.540 --> 03:46.290
<b>Let me go!</b>

03:49.630 --> 03:52.540
<b>Stale! I want you to teleport me!</b>

03:52.920 --> 03:53.500
<b>Okay!</b>

03:53.880 --> 03:57.920
<b>And then, go with Chancellor Gilbert
to where Miss Marianne is!</b>

03:58.290 --> 03:59.380
<b>With Gilbert?</b>

03:59.710 --> 04:02.710
<b>Come get me when you arrive in Miss Marianne's room.</b>

04:03.750 --> 04:06.460
<b>All right. But Pride, where are you going?!</b>

04:10.750 --> 04:12.630
<b>Captain! Vice Captain!</b>

04:14.330 --> 04:16.170
<b>Princess Pride?! Why are you here?</b>

04:17.330 --> 04:19.790
<b>I'll tell you what's going on later.</b>

04:20.500 --> 04:23.380
<b>More importantly, call Arthur!
We have an emergency situation!</b>

04:24.170 --> 04:26.670
<b>Arthur Bersford!</b>

04:28.540 --> 04:29.250
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

04:31.790 --> 04:32.580
<b>There you go!</b>

04:35.210 --> 04:36.210
<b>Princess Pride?</b>

04:38.710 --> 04:40.210
<b>There's someone I want to save.</b>

04:41.500 --> 04:43.920
<b>But in order to do that, you...</b>

04:44.500 --> 04:47.630
<b>Your life will have to change in a major way.</b>

04:48.830 --> 04:52.960
<b>Not even I know if the result will be good or bad.</b>

04:53.960 --> 04:55.250
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

04:57.040 --> 05:01.580
<b>You changed my life long ago.</b>

05:04.500 --> 05:07.790
<b>I will sacrifice this life if it's for you.</b>

05:16.250 --> 05:17.000
<b>Pride!</b>

05:18.210 --> 05:20.670
<b>Stale?! Why do you look like that?</b>

05:21.920 --> 05:24.000
<b>There's no time to explain now! Hurry!</b>

05:26.460 --> 05:30.170
<b>Maria... No, you can't!</b>

05:30.670 --> 05:33.790
<b>Please, don't die!</b>

05:34.460 --> 05:35.500
<b>Maria!</b>

05:36.420 --> 05:39.000
<b>Arthur, lay your hand on her.</b>

05:44.210 --> 05:48.750
<b>Arthur, your special ability isn't limited to only crops.</b>

05:49.290 --> 05:51.420
<b>Your actual special ability is...</b>

05:53.880 --> 05:56.290
<b>the power to heal all of creation!</b>

06:09.710 --> 06:10.500
<b>Maria!</b>

06:15.170 --> 06:16.040
<b>Maria?</b>

06:20.920 --> 06:21.830
<b>Gil...</b>

06:24.250 --> 06:29.000
<b>I am happy.</b>

06:56.170 --> 06:59.330
<b>Thank you. I can be with Gil again...</b>

07:00.330 --> 07:05.540
<b>Thank you for saving Gil, and for saving me!</b>

07:09.380 --> 07:14.830
<b>Arthur was supposed to have understood
the truth of his ability 5 years from now.</b>

07:15.880 --> 07:20.630
<b>I've twisted that. But I have no regrets.</b>

07:21.250 --> 07:24.460
<b>I've made my decision with everything in mind.</b>

07:25.500 --> 07:26.330
<b>Pride.</b>

07:29.250 --> 07:31.750
<b>Stale, thank you so much.</b>

07:34.500 --> 07:39.380
<b>Was I able to be of use to you and grant your wish?</b>

07:42.330 --> 07:43.580
<b>Of course you were.</b>

07:48.000 --> 07:51.330
<b>But Stale, what is with that body?</b>

07:53.790 --> 07:54.960
<b>Gilbert...</b>

07:59.000 --> 08:00.500
<b>Hurry, Gilbert!</b>

08:00.750 --> 08:01.540
<b>Wait!</b>

08:02.630 --> 08:03.330
<b>Hm?</b>

08:08.540 --> 08:11.250
<b>This person can get there somewhat faster.</b>

08:13.250 --> 08:17.500
<b>He can even manipulate the ages
of others... how extraordinary.</b>

08:18.000 --> 08:19.000
<b>Princess Pride!</b>

08:20.040 --> 08:28.380
<b>I am truly, truly, grateful to you!</b>

08:29.000 --> 08:30.750
<b>Lift your head.</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:34.790
<b>I am not the one who saved Miss Marianna.</b>

08:34.790 --> 08:35.540
<b>I-!</b>

08:36.420 --> 08:40.040
<b>I've committed so many unforgivable acts!</b>

08:41.380 --> 08:49.170
<b>I spread vicious rumors around the castle about you, and
I tried to get more allies for law resolution committee.</b>

08:49.920 --> 08:55.290
<b>And what's more, I continued purchasing the information
of special ability users from people in immoral dealings!</b>

08:55.750 --> 08:59.130
<b>And as for earlier, I intended to give them anything;</b>

08:59.130 --> 09:04.460
<b>intel on the castle's defenses, information about you,
and the same about the royal family!</b>

09:05.790 --> 09:07.420
<b>I have prepared myself!</b>

09:08.420 --> 09:12.500
<b>I am ready to undergo any punishment fit for me!</b>

09:15.670 --> 09:20.790
<b>Am I correct in thinking that you are
entrusting me with your judgment?</b>

09:20.960 --> 09:21.630
<b>Yes!</b>

09:22.960 --> 09:26.960
<b>I have no intention of blaming you for this.</b>

09:28.630 --> 09:35.210
<b>However, now that I've heard what you've done
from you yourself, in no way can I excuse this.</b>

09:36.080 --> 09:37.170
<b>I would not expect you to!</b>

09:43.710 --> 09:45.250
<b>Gilbert Butler.</b>

09:50.460 --> 09:51.880
<b>Gilbert Butler.</b>

09:59.920 --> 10:05.000
<b>Are you prepared... to disclose all of this
to my mother and father?</b>

10:06.130 --> 10:07.000
<b>What?!</b>

10:07.460 --> 10:11.250
<b>You are tormented by the consciousness
of your punishment,</b>

10:11.750 --> 10:16.420
<b>but you have had no one to pass judgment
on you for your crimes so far.</b>

10:19.670 --> 10:22.460
<b>I command Miss Marianne and the maids to do this:</b>

10:23.080 --> 10:26.290
<b>Please forget everything you have seen and heard here.</b>

10:27.380 --> 10:28.330
<b>I don't believe it...</b>

10:28.830 --> 10:32.830
<b>Are you saying you will forgive me?
An abhorrent criminal like me?</b>

10:32.830 --> 10:36.670
<b>I will not forgive you. Make an oath, right here.</b>

10:37.290 --> 10:43.920
<b>To me, to everyone here, and to her,
your beloved who you would throw it all away for.</b>

10:44.790 --> 10:50.580
<b>You will work for the people of this country,
as long as the monarch desires that you do so,</b>

10:51.290 --> 10:53.880
<b>and continue on as the chancellor of our country.</b>

10:59.170 --> 11:01.960
<b>He's someone who can manipulate age
and never grow old.</b>

11:02.540 --> 11:08.250
<b>Even when we die... even when
his beloved Marianne dies of old age.</b>

11:08.750 --> 11:13.670
<b>If he says he will keep this vow,
then he must continue to live.</b>

11:15.210 --> 11:17.290
<b>Just like at the end of the game.</b>

11:22.500 --> 11:26.210
<b>In the Gil route, it ended with a vow to Tiara.</b>

11:28.040 --> 11:32.580
<b>There is no doubt that this corporeal body
will go to hell for my sins.</b>

11:33.580 --> 11:34.790
<b>That being the case,</b>

11:34.790 --> 11:41.290
<b>I promise I will continue to protect
the people of this country you love,</b>

11:42.250 --> 11:43.830
<b>until divine judgment is handed down upon me...</b>

11:46.630 --> 11:47.920
<b>Certainly...</b>

11:50.670 --> 11:53.000
<b>I vow here and now,</b>

11:53.380 --> 11:59.830
<b>that until the moment my heart ceases to beat, I will
continue to protect the people of this country you love.</b>

12:01.040 --> 12:02.580
<b>This is the only way...</b>

12:03.460 --> 12:08.500
<b>I'm sorry I can only pass judgment on you
by binding you to your Chancellor duties.</b>

12:21.000 --> 12:21.830
<b>Huh?!</b>

12:26.630 --> 12:28.460
<b>Could he possibly be...</b>

12:29.130 --> 12:32.330
<b>I get it! That's not what this is about!</b>

12:33.170 --> 12:37.710
<b>The back of the hand means reverence,
and the tips of the toes mean adoration!</b>

12:38.250 --> 12:40.130
<b>The back of the leg is servitude!</b>

12:41.170 --> 12:43.080
<b>The shin is obedience!</b>

12:43.630 --> 12:45.330
<b>But still...</b>

12:51.580 --> 12:53.170
<b>Don't look!</b>

12:57.000 --> 12:59.960
<b>I will take this opportunity to pledge myself to you.</b>

13:00.920 --> 13:05.170
<b>The First Princess of our country,
Your Highness, Pride Royal Ivy.</b>

13:05.960 --> 13:10.880
<b>I pledge my wholehearted allegiance here and now.</b>

13:12.830 --> 13:18.790
<b>For giving a serious criminal like me a chance
to once again devote myself to the country,</b>

13:19.130 --> 13:20.830
<b>I give you my utmost gratitude.</b>

13:21.630 --> 13:25.960
<b>I will never forget this kindness,
including what was done for Marianne.</b>

13:29.580 --> 13:31.040
<b>That's a promise.</b>

13:36.540 --> 13:38.250
<b>I thought you'd be in here.</b>

13:39.170 --> 13:43.210
<b>By the way, I've told you not to hang out
in places without the owner of that place there.</b>

13:44.250 --> 13:47.670
<b>Did you talk with the captain
of the knights about your ability?</b>

13:47.960 --> 13:50.540
<b>Yeah, then I talked to Clark about it.</b>

13:52.750 --> 13:53.790
<b>Were they surprised?</b>

13:54.580 --> 13:55.920
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

13:57.580 --> 13:59.960
<b>Are you sure you'll stay a knight?</b>

14:00.750 --> 14:04.460
<b>Your special ability truly has amazing value.</b>

14:05.420 --> 14:09.630
<b>You could make a fortune,
and become a member of the royal family...</b>

14:10.130 --> 14:16.000
<b>If you make your name as a doctor, you'll be able to
save loads more people than if you remained a knight.</b>

14:17.920 --> 14:20.000
<b>It's not about staying a knight.</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:23.380
<b>I am a knight.</b>

14:25.210 --> 14:26.130
<b>I see.</b>

14:27.420 --> 14:30.040
<b>Princess Pride was unfair for all of that.</b>

14:30.290 --> 14:33.630
<b>Give it up, Elder Sister has always been that way.</b>

14:34.670 --> 14:35.830
<b>I know that.</b>

14:37.630 --> 14:41.630
<b>So? You were fine with it all, huh?</b>

14:42.170 --> 14:43.170
<b>With what?</b>

14:43.580 --> 14:47.080
<b>You don't think much of Chancellor Gilbert.</b>

14:47.540 --> 14:48.580
<b>Right.</b>

14:49.630 --> 14:53.630
<b>Honestly, I can't forgive him,
and there were some close calls.</b>

14:54.920 --> 14:57.380
<b>Well, it was all because Elder Sister was there.</b>

14:57.960 --> 14:59.710
<b>Aren't you pissed?</b>

15:02.210 --> 15:03.080
<b>I suppose.</b>

15:04.080 --> 15:09.000
<b>What I'm saying is that lying smile
isn't gonna work on me! Cut the crap!</b>

15:09.790 --> 15:13.960
<b>If there's something you wanna say,
spit it out! I know you're pissed off!</b>

15:14.210 --> 15:18.210
<b>That jerk trampling all over your and
Princess Pride's efforts pissed you off!</b>

15:18.790 --> 15:22.130
<b>Yeah, I'm pissed!</b>

15:22.830 --> 15:25.710
<b>Just what is up with that guy?!</b>

15:26.210 --> 15:28.250
<b>He's always nagging and nagging and nagging and</b>

15:28.250 --> 15:31.880
<b>he'd spew such sarcastic things
at Elder Sister with that cold face of his!</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.040
<b>And still, his job as a chancellor is superior and
on top of that he's more powerful than me?!</b>

15:33.880 --> 15:35.830
<b>Hey! That's my...</b>

15:38.500 --> 15:39.960
<b>Give me a break!</b>

15:40.330 --> 15:43.790
<b>What?! You call that strong? That cryptic-eyed jerk!</b>

15:44.000 --> 15:46.630
<b>He is strong! That cryptic-eyed jerk!</b>

15:51.080 --> 15:54.500
<b>Maybe... I didn't protect Elder Sister!</b>

15:55.790 --> 16:01.040
<b>That time Gilbert's rage was aimed directly at her...</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:04.460
<b>In the end, I...</b>

16:05.000 --> 16:07.040
<b>I was powerless against that man.</b>

16:07.880 --> 16:10.790
<b>Even though I've been through so much so far...</b>

16:11.330 --> 16:15.330
<b>up to now and including today,
I couldn't protect Elder Sis-</b>

16:17.130 --> 16:18.250
<b>Ya dummy!</b>

16:18.580 --> 16:22.830
<b>The hell do you mean you couldn't protect her?!
You WERE protecting her!</b>

16:23.420 --> 16:26.380
<b>You've been protecting Princess Pride
way before even I was!</b>

16:28.130 --> 16:33.380
<b>When I was a little kid, the entire town was teeming
with awful rumors about Princess Pride.</b>

16:33.790 --> 16:36.250
<b>But now, I hardly hear a thing.</b>

16:37.880 --> 16:39.420
<b>You stamped them out.</b>

16:40.000 --> 16:46.170
<b>You continued to support her the entire time
so Princess Pride wouldn't suffer a setback.</b>

16:46.170 --> 16:47.500
<b>That was all you!</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:51.080
<b>You think you may not have protected the princess?</b>

16:51.290 --> 16:52.630
<b>Of course, you did!</b>

16:53.380 --> 16:57.540
<b>But do you really think you can protect them
from any and everything?!</b>

16:57.790 --> 16:59.420
<b>That's why I'm here!</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:04.210
<b>You're the "shield" and I'm the "sword", right?!</b>

17:07.540 --> 17:08.500
<b>Let's make a promise.</b>

17:09.460 --> 17:14.210
<b>From here on, when Princess Pride makes a move,
you must be sure to call me, no matter what happens.</b>

17:14.830 --> 17:15.920
<b>Without question.</b>

17:16.670 --> 17:22.290
<b>I will protect Princess Pride, you, and Tiara.</b>

17:26.130 --> 17:29.920
<b>But you are too flashy!</b>

17:29.920 --> 17:33.420
<b>And you're smart enough and
you're a good enough swordsman!</b>

17:33.420 --> 17:34.500
<b>Stop it, you idiot!</b>

17:35.130 --> 17:35.670
<b>Tch.</b>

17:39.580 --> 17:42.000
<b>Will the castle maids be rewashing that?</b>

17:42.420 --> 17:46.630
<b>Someone like me who works for
the royal family can't use the maids.</b>

17:48.040 --> 17:49.500
<b>You sure are mature.</b>

17:50.210 --> 17:53.790
<b>You're way more of an adult compared to me.</b>

17:54.130 --> 17:55.500
<b>Are you being humble?</b>

17:56.210 --> 18:03.290
<b>When I was just a year older than you are now,
I was pathetically bawling my eyes out.</b>

18:03.290 --> 18:04.540
<b>I'm sure you know about it.</b>

18:04.540 --> 18:06.880
<b>Would it have been more mature if you hadn't cried?</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:09.920
<b>No, that's not what I mean...</b>

18:10.790 --> 18:11.420
<b>I've decided.</b>

18:12.080 --> 18:13.080
<b>On what?</b>

18:14.130 --> 18:17.040
<b>I absolutely will not cry again.</b>

18:17.670 --> 18:20.250
<b>Do you mean you won't ever cry again?</b>

18:20.540 --> 18:24.920
<b>In any case, I won't cry until I'm the same age
as Gilbert changed me into today.</b>

18:25.790 --> 18:27.580
<b>Most likely, around 5 years.</b>

18:28.960 --> 18:30.580
<b>Okay, I'll join you in that.</b>

18:30.920 --> 18:31.630
<b>What?</b>

18:33.170 --> 18:36.330
<b>That's 5 years. You think I'll let you do it alone?</b>

18:36.670 --> 18:39.000
<b>Besides, it's perfect for starting a clean slate.</b>

18:39.790 --> 18:42.830
<b>Wait, Arthur, this is something I've resolved to do.</b>

18:43.420 --> 18:44.790
<b>It has nothing to do with you.</b>

18:45.210 --> 18:46.670
<b>What's the point?</b>

18:46.920 --> 18:48.500
<b>Because ever since two years ago,</b>

18:48.500 --> 18:53.210
<b>I've only shown myself looking
especially pathetic to you and Princess Pride.</b>

18:53.880 --> 18:56.420
<b>I don't want to be seen like that ever again.</b>

18:57.540 --> 18:58.670
<b>Well, but...</b>

18:59.630 --> 19:02.460
<b>We're strong, you and me.</b>

19:05.080 --> 19:06.000
<b>I agree.</b>

19:17.290 --> 19:22.500
<b>Thank you all so much for coming,
Princess Pride, Prince Stale, Princess Tiara.</b>

19:31.710 --> 19:36.290
<b>Say, Big Brother, do you really hate Chancellor Gilbert?</b>

19:37.250 --> 19:38.420
<b>I don't hate him.</b>

19:39.460 --> 19:40.750
<b>I despise him.</b>

19:41.380 --> 19:45.040
<b>Enough to think that Maria shouldn't have been saved?</b>

19:46.710 --> 19:48.080
<b>I didn't say that.</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:53.580
<b>I like both Maria and Chancellor Gilbert.</b>

19:54.380 --> 19:57.880
<b>I'm so, so glad that they can be happy.</b>

19:58.880 --> 20:04.170
<b>Big Brother, you don't really hate
Chancellor Gilbert that much, do you?</b>

20:04.170 --> 20:04.920
<b>What?</b>

20:05.460 --> 20:12.040
<b>I mean, rather than seeing Chancellor Gilbert
as an enemy like you did a long time ago,</b>

20:12.330 --> 20:14.250
<b>recently you seem to be jealous of him.</b>

20:14.250 --> 20:15.170
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:20.040
<b>Weren't you always working hard
to be better than Chancellor Gilbert?</b>

20:20.420 --> 20:23.250
<b>You were thinking about how
you wanted to protect Big Sister, right?</b>

20:24.290 --> 20:25.040
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:25.500 --> 20:29.250
<b>But even so, Big Sister trusts Chancellor Gilbert,</b>

20:29.250 --> 20:34.170
<b>and even as chancellor he's very successful,
and he can't be beat in an argument.</b>

20:35.210 --> 20:38.330
<b>But you're too worried about
Chancellor Gilbert, Big Brother!</b>

20:39.790 --> 20:43.460
<b>Please, Tiara, just leave it alone.</b>

20:44.830 --> 20:46.790
<b>Stale, what's wrong?</b>

20:48.290 --> 20:51.670
<b>It's all right. Big Brother is just a little tired.</b>

20:51.960 --> 20:52.960
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

20:53.580 --> 20:55.080
<b>Just relax tonight, then.</b>

20:55.540 --> 20:56.790
<b>Have some water.</b>

21:03.920 --> 21:07.920
<b>But I'm sure of it, I can't forgive you... and I hate you.</b>

21:09.250 --> 21:10.330
<b>Is that so?</b>

21:11.250 --> 21:17.380
<b>Then from here on, I shall respectfully take
your words as a challenge, Prince Stale.</b>

21:24.210 --> 21:28.250
<b>I have an announcement for everyone
who has kindly gathered here tonight.</b>

